ator app.'=>'請使用 Google Authenticator 應用程式掃描。','Secondary Login Screen'=>'第二登入畫面','Secret'=>'金鑰','Show/Hide QR code'=>'顯示/隱藏 QR 碼','Sorry, this role is enabled at the network level and can only be disabled via the <a href="%s">network settings</a>'=>'很抱歉，此角色已在網路層級啟用，只能透過<a href="%s">網路設定</a>停用','Sorry, you can\'t disable checks for this role as it\'s enabled at the network level.'=>'很抱歉，此角色已在網路層級啟用，你無法停用其檢查。','Successfully saved your settings for the network'=>'已成功儲存網路設定','Successfully saved your settings for the site'=>'已成功儲存網站設定','The easiest way to enable your account is to add an account by scanning the QR code using the app.'=>'啟用帳號最簡單的方式，是使用應用程式掃描 QR 碼來新增帳號。','Two Screen Signin'=>'分步登入','Verify Authenticator Code'=>'確認驗證碼','iOS: Authy'=>'iOS: Authy','iOS: Google Authenticator'=>'iOS: Google Authenticator','iOS: Microsoft Authenticator'=>'iOS: Microsoft Authenticator']];
